    {
      "id": "claim_f0317ef82e8042d48f22c27f9b5d589e",
      "statement": "`CHECKOUT_AUTH_BYPASS` is a debug-only backend toggle: config parses it as a boolean but only activates it when `GIN_MODE` is `debug`, bootstrap then applies `orderH.WithDevelopmentAuthBypass()` to checkout handling, and tests verify that release mode disables the bypass and invalid boolean values are rejected.",
