    {
      "id": "claim_5014e8711bec48d38d2547c278d53865",
      "statement": "The backend health endpoint is `GET /health`; it pings both the database and Redis, returns HTTP 200 with status `ok` when both are healthy, and returns HTTP 503 with status `degraded` when either dependency check fails.",
