      "statement": "The AI runtime mounts its chat router under `/api/v1`, exposes `GET /health` returning `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`, and currently serves `POST /api/v1/chat`, `POST /api/v1/chat/stream`, and `POST /api/v1/greeting`, with integration tests covering those routes and SSE event behavior.",
